## Installation & Setup

### Prerequisites
- Minimum 4GB RAM (1GB minimum)
- 5GB disk space
- Java Runtime Environment (JRE)

### Basic Installation Steps (Windows)
```bash
# Run installer
1. Download from oracle.com
2. Run setup.exe
3. Choose installation type
4. Specify installation path
5. Configure database
6. Set passwords
7. Complete installation
```

### Create Database
```sql
-- Manual creation
CREATE DATABASE mydb
  DATAFILE '/u01/oradata/mydb.dbf' SIZE 100M
  LOGFILE GROUP 1 ('/u01/logs/log1a.rdo') SIZE 50M,
          GROUP 2 ('/u01/logs/log2a.rdo') SIZE 50M;
```

### Connection
```bash
# Using sqlplus
sqlplus username/password@database

# Using command line
sqlplus /nolog
SQL> CONNECT username/password;
```

### Check Database Status
```sql
-- Is database open?
SELECT status FROM v$instance;

-- Show all parameters
SHOW PARAMETER;

-- Show specific parameter
SHOW PARAMETER db_name;
```

